  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I think I got the wrong number. I was trying to reach the fire department, the regular line, not the emergency one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem. This is the City Clerk at City Hall. You want the fire department's non-emergency line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I looked it up on my phone and I'm on speaker here, sorry, I'm in a waiting room at the dealership. They've got my car in for service."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Do you remember what number you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put in the seven digits, and then it wouldn't go through, so I added a 508 in front. Is that not right? Is it 401 or 508? I never know anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport is 401. You don't want the 508, that's Massachusetts. [pause] Hang on, I can transfer you over to the fire department right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, wicked, totally, that'd be great. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:13:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Stay on the line, it'll ring through. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, thanks."
    }
  ],
